 class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t2-l-q22\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>how quickly they wear out.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">23</strong><span>Bella says that she sometimes recycles shoes because</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t2-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>they no longer fit.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t2-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>she no longer likes them.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t2-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>they are no longer in fashion.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong><span>What did the article say that confused Don?</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t2-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>Public consumption of footwear has risen.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t2-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>Less footwear is recycled now than in the past.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c19-t2-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>People dispose of more footwear than they used to.</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4},{"id":"en-c19-t2-l-g3-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuesti